Skills: Go Testing

Purpose:
  Go testing skills organized by test type.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1  @INDEX.sdd
   2  @L1-unit-testing.sdd
   3  @L2-integration-testing.sdd

Modes:
  LEARN    — learn Go testing patterns
  APPLY    — apply Go testing to code
  REVIEW   — review Go testing skills
  UPGRADE  — propose Go testing skill upgrade

Rules:
  [T1]  Tests MUST follow Go testing conventions.
  [T2]  Use table-driven tests for multiple cases.
  [T3]  Use subtests for related assertions.
  [T4]  Mock external dependencies.
  [T5]  Tests MUST be independent.

